+.. admonition:: Object key order is not guaranteed to be preserved
+
+    JSON objects are unordered collections of key/value pairs (:rfc:`8259`).
+    Although Python's :class:`dict` preserves insertion order, you should not
+    rely on ``JSONField`` preserving that order when storing and retrieving
+    data.
+
